<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25582" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαποικίλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>variegate, adorn with variety,</i> mostly metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς διαιτήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					3.68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					9.9
				</span></i>
			; literally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τι ἀργύρῳ καὶ χρυσῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sert.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλανι <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ</span>,</span>
			<i>to be dappled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				503b5
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐκ . .</span>
			<i>to be blended of various</i> sorts, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				693d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				863a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάταις τὰ πολλὰ δ. τοῦ πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i>.</div>
